 "title": "A Railroad For Horses!",
 "cat": "history",
 "emoji": "🚂",
 "sentences": [
  "This stone-hauling railroad started for horses!",
  "Founded in 1903 by Louis A. Fisk, it originally carried passengers to a trotting park.",
  "The line later expanded to serve stone quarries.",
  "The Branford Steam Railroad took control of the Damascus Railroad in 1909.",
  "By 1916, passenger business ended in favor of freight.",
  "It has hauled trap rock continuously since 1914."
